## If something feels off

| Problem | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| Agent ignores my voice / rules | You forgot the "Read AGENTS.md..." opening line. Say it now. |
| Files keep landing in `review/needs-ai-decision/` | Say `!review` in chat. The agent will go through the queue. |
| Generated `DATA_PLACEMENT_EXAMPLES.md` doesn't fit me | Edit `examples/<role>.yml`, then say `!populate`. |
| Watcher won't pick up files | Check `./watcher.sh --status`. Make sure files are in `raw/<sub>/unsorted/`, not just `raw/`. |
| Need a smoke test of the install | Run `./doctor.sh` (or `python3 scripts/kb_doctor.py`). |

